","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-373c-7f1d-96a0-d86f5f91d9e2","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"According to the bible, who were the baby Jesus\'s first visitors?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Luke says the Shepherds went to Bethlehem after an angel announced Jesus\'s birth to them while they watched their flocks.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-373c-721c-b5a2-055e013c3871","description":"The Shepherds","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-373c-74d7-84e3-b8f0749191fd","description":"Three Wise Men","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-373c-7498-8888-082c12af31a9","description":"King Herod","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-373c-7e81-bfa5-795e4cb5da9e","description":"The Stable Boy","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-373c-7596-a1da-1c316b58346b","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"In western societies, what is the traditional gift for a 10th wedding anniversary?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Tin\'s chemical symbol, Sn, comes from its Latin name, stannum.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-373c-7976-a927-e624503d7a39","description":"Tin","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-373c-7f5d-88aa-2c8cf165c8c7","description":"Gold","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-373c-7e1a-9080-4a63a3e005e5","description":"Silver","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-373c-72fd-a7f6-4f20655cb19d","description":"Bronze","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-373c-74de-886f-e9aa5baa981f","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"Which of the following describes Gregory Pincus?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Gregory Pincus worked with researcher Min Chueh Chang, and gynecologist John Rock led early clinical trials. Enovid became the first oral contraceptive approved in the United States.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-373c-78cd-831f-d4ce35f8a31c","description":"Biologist who created the oral contraceptive pill.","correct_answer