lso an English statesman whose emphasis on observation and experiment helped shape modern scientific inquiry.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-373c-7b7c-8b9d-cfa2b3da2e23","description":"Francis Bacon","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-373c-7562-a275-97a70a887cd8","description":"Jean-Paul Sartre","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-373c-775b-93c1-c0c0722c5541","description":"Socrates","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-373c-74a1-ba0e-7f87fb74d784","description":"William of Ockham","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-373c-77af-a221-99446d510677","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"Which of these languages would you find spoken in Angola?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Portuguese is Angola\u2019s official language, a legacy of its colonial history.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-373c-7d41-93fe-93b12f7223a5","description":"Portuguese","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-373c-7790-b83d-3d3be07d6e51","description":"Hindi","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-373c-7b64-9e12-9b7c1c2e9365","description":"Berber","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-373c-7304-b989-5018ee06fdd0","description":"Gujarati","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-373c-78de-833a-91c5693efe9a","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"The language \'Bengali\' belongs to which language family?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Bengali is an Indo-Aryan language, a branch of the Indo-European family.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-373c-7da1-840a-facb44cb15dd","description":"Indo-European","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-373c-7fae-941a-e380adf5e902","description":"Afroasiatic","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-373c-7cdf-94fa-24a8466ca32e","description":"Sino-Tibetan","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-373c-7c03-846a-1015731d2207","description":"Uralic","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-373c-72a1-bff0-ff7fe7c30ccb","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-