er":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-373c-7aeb-ad7f-4fe0d7ac695d","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"The language \'Rundi\' belongs to which language family?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Rundi, also called Kirundi, is a Bantu language, and Bantu languages form a major branch of the Niger\u2013Congo family.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-373c-73dc-a995-29989cd90d5c","description":"Niger\u2013Congo","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-373c-7395-8a1f-0269f1f2092f","description":"Dravidian","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-373c-7f80-be94-69094c96c4af","description":"Austronesian","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-373c-7d27-a4be-c27b9b64f7d4","description":"Koreanic","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-373c-7f43-a680-00f662bb8d76","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"Which photography brand is associated with the marketing slogan \'At the heart of the image\'?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Nikon began as Nippon Kogaku K.K., a Japanese optics maker, and released its first camera in 1948.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-373c-7055-ba9b-2aefe9fcb38a","description":"Nikon","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-373c-7329-a456-1f2bb1700cb4","description":"Olympus","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-373c-7154-b845-c109a1593260","description":"Kodak","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-373c-73e2-848b-950aa5e317b7","description":"Canon","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-373c-7997-9021-71316dbf1dfc","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"How does that Latin phrase \'Humilitas occidit superbiam\' translate into English?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Humility conquers pride: occidit literally means \u201ckills,\u201d giving the phrase the force of one virtue defeating an opposing vice.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-373c-7264-b3dc-69aa7d97500b","description":"Humility conquers pride","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218